{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_(Guess&amp;Check)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution (Guess&amp;Check)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4,_(the_most_complicated,_just_math)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4, (the most complicated, just math)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Jami picked three equally spaced integer numbers on the number line. The sum of the first and the second numbers is 40, while the sum of the second and third numbers is 60. What is the sum of all three numbers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/2/e625d8ecdf5d72b6caf3ea98d80d4fc568651fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 70\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 75\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 80\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 85\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the integers are equally spaced, they form an arithmetic sequence, so we can label the middle term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, the smallest one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/0/730a04d09740e0b0f50d1140c614f6e7840e9bbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> and the largest one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83c9c3a8da8388f2c9107e68f8fe59683cd0cdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />. We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/f/49f3cb0511f843c57106ed94e34c4dc701082e42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-d)+a=2a-d=40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"206\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/e/eae7a24fa9b18a99699e1556ac8eb40f3e837475.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+(a+d)=2a+d=60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"206\" height=\"20\" />. Solving, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a857a3f80585eac1447ee6877b41b42a70e7534a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a-d)+(2a+d)=4a=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"248\" height=\"20\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/bef7dc7a6d7c16af2131aba408fb43802da0db90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />. The problem asks for the sum of all 3 numbers, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/8/4d87dcb4be5a6c4e464deb73587b881c977bf2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-d)+a+(a+d)=3a=3 \\cdot 25 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} 75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"356\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~mrtnvlknv\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.28Guess.26Check.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_(Guess&amp;Check)\">Solution (Guess&amp;Check)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution (Guess&amp;Check)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are equally spaced on a number line so we have to start with guess and check since the other solutions take longer. Since a+b = 40 and b+c= 60, we can first try for possibilities of a and b. If a=20 then b=20 they are not equally spaced, if a= 10 then b = 30 so c will be 30, also not equally spaced. So, we have to try 15, if a=15 and b=25 then c =35, yay this works for the answer would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/7/21719a1f73c69e290b7d1672afadd2f3315e7066.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} 75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Aarnavisthebest\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are equally spaced by a distance <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> on the number line. Then, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30a38333bdd5d3b2fa3d5f7f688046a59b30f997.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0d7514235534598d22c03f49328c92317faf18c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a+2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"16\" />. Then, the sum of the first and second numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/c/f1c8a676b08a1481dd49ab9fcf978f1de83ffa83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+a+k = 40 = 2a+k = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"236\" height=\"16\" />, and the sum of the second and third numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/f/a1f78d67cdd4b80aa9d9d44cf24def184b1ef789.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+k+a+2k = 2a+3k = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"244\" height=\"16\" />. Then, solving we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/9/7d92196d35e473a2995fc067730bf52f7ed13e99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2k = -20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/5/5c593c45953fbca6d0da4893f2126c6f16bf6cf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/a/cda14dd41bce445625ae51130c235376d183ff54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+10 = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/d/f2de4c36487ff7030d59b77f9e904b8db4bea9ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a= 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa28140605d6a1d0be3718aa184f1d1ec040d620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=25$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f04ae7b84f8852ffd40a5e62dc6405a1bc5bdfc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of all three is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/8602852dd63ce3744ba16223dd2448c2b76cd5fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+25+35 = 70+5 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} 75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"257\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The difference of the sum of the first two integers and the sum of the last two integers differs by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Hence, the common difference of the arithmetic sequence must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The only way for the sum of two integers in an arithmetic sequence with common difference 10 to have a sum ending in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is for all the integers to end in either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b835f2c6c592edc4583ce996f86bcc0d07ca8da5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Testing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> does not meet the required sum for the first two integers in the sequence. However, the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55ca593e2a024a51afd96cdba7da8f7403c216d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" /> and adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/0/060c5bc5c12fc7926d92f2fa6538fc6177b8f75b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35 (25+10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> matches up with the sum of the last two integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/c/d9cc0e60360d27bb0d68fba6cd6fc1f5163aedd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60.$\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> Consequently, the arithmetic sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d088c9cd7ce97bd25cdc88a6eeb0e2d9afcdabc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15, 25, 35,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" /> with a common difference of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b833a70e5b34465a7e1cc445231d569f21b81da4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> Adding up all the terms in the sequence gives the answer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f3eb849159e9afd61b3b2b4c3dc9bf69ca27124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+25+35=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} 75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"183\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~zoyashaikh\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4.2C_.28the_most_complicated.2C_just_math.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4,_(the_most_complicated,_just_math)\">Solution 4, (the most complicated, just math)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4, (the most complicated, just math)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65f4ada03df5206ccf7df2bdbbfbb9a7db54d42b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + y = 40\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" /> (equation 1)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/b/3ab166cd12b899ad1aa2ee5bec34886b19a33111.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y + z = 60\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" /> (equation 2)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/7/b17cff64ce3f3f378197fe5f863b48193f1ec899.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = a, y = a + d, z = a + 2d\\]\" width=\"219\" height=\"16\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/3544649c562c6c693a24e3f2e367cb4e10f20463.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + x + d = 40\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"14\" /> (equation 1)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/4/2c4baa6acb2aea59a4a4c618d3b4e5c816f21264.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + d + x + 2d = 40\\]\" width=\"156\" height=\"14\" /> (equation 2)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/8/9783d103ab9de9a039a393965b0ee2745fab063d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2x + 3d) - (2x + d) = 20\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" /> (eqs. 1 and 2 subtracted)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/a/5dab96fb6c6a31441713e5d3d368f4cfdde44936.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2d = 20, d = 10\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/e/0bebaca1fdd4ef4e3eaea781ff33998f8e32d8b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a + 10 = 40, a = 15\\]\" width=\"160\" height=\"16\" /> (substitute)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/3/0a398f80d768c1affbdafe55f93842d1fbd5f912.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a + a + d + a + 2d = 15 + 15 + 10 + 15 + 20 = \\boxed{75}\\]\" width=\"403\" height=\"23\" /> (plug in and substitute)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U\">https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U</a>\n</p><p>~TheSmartGreekMathDude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk\">https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Thinking Feet\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ieI9X4Fe6hE\">https://youtu.be/ieI9X4Fe6hE</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_.28AIME_Qualifier.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3GmtxMC-W1I&amp;t=1407s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3GmtxMC-W1I&amp;t=1407s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"